      en: ["Located approximately 40 kilometers northwest of Agadir.", "Marks the westernmost extremity of the High Atlas range.", "The iconic Cap Ghir lighthouse was established in 1932.", "Serves as a critical navigation landmark for Atlantic shipping.", "Famous for geological layers containing diverse ancient fossils.", "Premier location for seasonal whale watching along the coast."],
